out/

# MPLAB X CMake export (generated); keep hand-written user.cmake.
# Covers both the repo-root cmake/ export and any under LWFDSPC.X/.
cmake/**/.generated/
cmake/**/CMake*
!cmake/**/user.cmake
LWFDSPC.X/cmake/**/.generated/
LWFDSPC.X/cmake/**/CMake*
!LWFDSPC.X/cmake/**/user.cmake
